 "source_type": "instagram",
 "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdPz4vYvmbo/",
 "title": "Professional Alternative Phrases for Business and Client Communication",
 "topic": "communication",
 "summary": "Voice coach Paran Thakur presents alternative phrasing options to replace tentative or overly apologetic business language. The main lesson is to speak with authority like an established business owner rather than apologizing for operational decisions.",
 "key_points": [
  "Replace \"I'm just a\" with \"I specialise in\".",
  "Replace \"honestly\" with \"here's the truth\".",
  "Replace \"I can do it for less\" with \"what's included at this level\".",
  "Replace \"contract\" with \"agreement\".",
  "Replace \"yeah so basically\" with \"here's exactly how this works\".",
  "Replace \"I'm not sure\" with \"Let me find out for you\".",
  "Replace \"My policy is\" with \"the way I protect my clients is\".",
  "Replace \"I'm fully booked\" with \"capacity on my priority list\".",
  "Replace \"does that sound ok\" with \"I'll get that taken care for you\".",
  "Replace \"I'm sorry I can't\" with \"what I can do for you is\"."
 ],
 "content": "Post text:\nInstagram reel/post by Paran Thakur | Voice Coach.\nText / caption:\nComment “Voice” I’ll send you my free million dollar voice roadmap. \n\nIf you’re a founder, creator or executive I offer free private voice strategy calls, the link is in my bio.\n\nMake a note of this post.\n\nTranscript:\nNever say \"I'm just a\", always say \"I specialise in\". Never say \"honestly\", always say \"here's the truth\". Never say \"I can do it for less\", always say \"what's included at this level\". Never say \"contract\", always say \"agreement\". Never say \"yeah so basically\", always say \"here's exactly how this works\". Never say \"I'm not sure\", always say \"Let me find out for you\". Never say \"My policy is\", always say \"the way I protect my clients is\". Never say \"I'm fully booked\", always say \"capacity on my priority list\". Never say \"does that sound ok\", always say \"I'll get that taken care for you\". Never say \"I'm sorry I can't\", always say \"what I can do for you is\". Stop apologizing for running a business. Speak like someone who's built one. If you want my blueprint to develop a deeper, more commanding voice, comment \"Voice\".\n\nOn-screen text:\n- NEVER SAY / ALWAYS SAY\n- I'm just a / I specialise in\n- honestly / here's the truth\n- I can do it for less / what's included at this level\n- contract / agreement\n- yeah so basically / here's exactly how this works\n- I'm not sure / Let me find out for you\n- My policy is / the way I protect my clients is\n- I'm fully booked / capacity on my priority list\n- does that sound ok / I'll get that taken care for you\n- Stop apologizing for running a business.\n- Speak like someone who's built one.\n- If you want my blueprint to develop a deeper, more commanding voice.\n- Comment \"Voice\"",
